# Belt-and-suspenders: a captured field-session bundle is memory JSON + plan/
# verdict artifacts ONLY. Raw audio must never be committed here — a stray
# exported stem is ignored even if someone drops one into a bundle by mistake.
# (`capture-session` already refuses to copy audio; this is the second lock.)
*.wav
*.wave
*.aif
*.aiff
*.flac
*.caf
*.ogg
*.mp3
*.m4a
*.aac
*.wma
*.opus
